I've been looking for a way to top my PPANICC-BUG (pacifist,
polyobjectless, atheist, nude, illiterate, celibate, conflict-less,
bag/boxless undying genoless) conduct.

What I've come up with is "ultrapacifist".  Ascend with a null kill
list.  Very, very, tricky.  You have to lock up your pet, and avoid
getting any more.  It should be possible, if you take advantage of the
loadstone duplication bug. The conduct wouldn't even require a stuffed
bones.  Simply finding a wand of wishing on one of the early levels
(i.e. 1-4) should be enough.  Playing a wizard with a starting spell
of 'sleep' would probably help.

It would be extremely easy to lose the conduct from some random
creature stepping on a trap, or falling victim to a wand zap or thrown
weapon.    Genociding 'a' and 'S' would help, in the sanctum and on
Astral.

There is a trick you can use to keep the Wizard of Yendor from
following you too much.  You can use the loadstone trick to duplicate
the Amulet, and let Rodney steal one of them off the ground on level
n+1 after you've stashed one on level n.

